\ subst's errors (batch-h-wrong.lean's w_occurs; the run stops at the
\ first error, so each other error has a file of its own: w-no-equation,
\ w-rfl-not-eq, w-sides, w-subst-var-used). h : a = a: a on the right,
\ but the left side is a too (Lean's "'a' occurs at").
theorem w_occurs
  Nat explicit: a
  a a = explicit: h
  True
:= by
  ' h by-subst
end w_occurs
